# Tenancy (planned — not built)

Use when implementing auth, branches, memberships, or orders. Read the full design first.

@docs/warehouse-tenancy-setup.md

## Summary

- **Branch** = tenant; shared-table multi-tenancy via `branch_id` FK
- **Roles** per branch via `BranchMembership`: Admin, Manager, User
- **Orders** belong to one branch; no cross-branch ordering
- `is_superuser` / `is_staff` = Django site admin only, not branch Admin role
- Custom `User` with email login (no username) — set `AUTH_USER_MODEL` before first migration of dependent apps
- Every tenant queryset must be branch-scoped (manager or explicit filter)

Do not implement tenancy features unless the user explicitly requests that phase.
